Vendored from https://github.com/lzfse/lzfse (Apple Inc., BSD-3-Clause).
Only the LZVN decoder is used, to decode decmpfs compression types 8 and 9.

Files are unmodified. The upstream source is also packaged in nixpkgs as
`lzfse`, but that package installs only lzfse.h and exports no lzvn_* symbols,
and lzfse_decode_buffer() cannot take a bare LZVN stream - decmpfs chunks have
no LZFSE block header - so the decoder is compiled from source here.

lzfse_internal.h declares lzvn_decode_buffer() but upstream never defines it;
libapfsrw drives the state-based lzvn_decode() instead (see apfsrw_lzvn.c).
